#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span> is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: Following the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span>, we should seek labour reforms, defence of the republic, and cooperation with the Weimar parties.
- @centrist: Remaining true to our convictions, we should seek to prevent a new <span style="color: #808080;">Kulturkampf</span>, and maintain stability.  
- @labor: We shall leave the tower and expand our electorate to protestants and <span style="color: #000000;">Christian</span>
 workers, and seek an interconfessional bloc with the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNVP**</span> .
- @reform: Following <span style="color: #808080;">Franz von Papen</span>, we should seek to centralize the regime, to rid germany of degeneracy and <span style=#c00000;"color: #9B0000;">Marxism</span>.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 8; communist_coalition += 1; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent += 5; ddp_relation += 3; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; nationalization_support += 1; kpd_relation += 3; ddp_left += 0.5; dvp_left += 1; lvp_left += 0.5

The <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span> supports cooperation with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>, labor reform, and interconfessionalism

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 8; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

The <span style="color: #000000;">Catholic Center</span> are pragmatic republicans who are most focused on mainatining stability and defending Catholic rights.

@labor
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labor") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labor"; labor_strength += 8; center_dissent += 5; wtb_support += 1; labor_dissent -= 5; kpd_relation -= 3

The Christian Labor wing supports broadaning our electoral base to Protestants and workers. They are also supportive of an interconfessional bloc with the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNVP**</span>.

@reform
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "reformist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "reformist"; reformist_strength += 8; democratization += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent += 5; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; kpd_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1; dvp_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The Right wing of our party seeks an alliance with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> to fight the influence of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>.

@socpat
view-if: social_patriot
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socpat") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socpat"; social_patriot_strength += 10; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 10; reformist_dissent += 5; z_relation += 6; dvp_relation += 6; ddp_relation += 6; lvp_relation += 6; kpd_relation -= 15; dvp_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The social patriot wing of the party, widely regarded as Schleicher's puppets, is the most supportive of the <span style='color: #c00000;'>**SPD**</span> and ADGB adopting a more nationalist stance.

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
